# Resume Game after the volumes, SaveAnywhere: ON (fixtures/menumusic:
# soundout's lba.cfg, the samples and the music on the OPL3, with the
# key, and the outside save). The save loads from the list, and the
# scene's tune 19, XMIDI, plays. Escape pauses it under the main menu,
# Options Menu and its volumes play tune 9 in its place, and their first
# entry fades tune 9. Back on the main menu, Resume Game plays tune 19
# again from its start, where tune 9 came back at full volume.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
hold 0.15
sleep 15
shot playing
key Escape
sleep 6
shot menu
hold 0.05
key Down Down Down Down Return
sleep 3
shot options
key Down Return
sleep 6
shot volume
key Return
sleep 3
shot back
key Up Return
sleep 3
shot main
key Return
sleep 10
shot resumed
